            "option": "\nLoaʻa iā ʻoe he <#b7462dff>7%<> <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:vamp_0> <#b7462dff>omo ola piha<> i nā moʻo.\n\n<#ff7a3eff>Nail<>: Hana nā hoʻouka kumu i nā moʻo i <#ff9028ff>15 pōʻino kino hou<> <#ffff99ff>ke pā<>."
        },
        "hunters_talisman": {
            "name": "Hunter's Talisman",
            "option": "\nLoaʻa iā ʻoe he <#b7462dff>7%<> <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:vamp_0> <#b7462dff>omo ola piha<> i nā moʻo.\n\n<#ff7a3eff>Tooth<>: Ke hana ʻoe i ka pōʻino i kekahi moʻo, ʻā ia i ke ahi no <#d94c49ff>5% o kona ola kiʻekiʻe<> ma ke ʻano he <#a974ffff>pōʻino kilokilo<> i loko o <#e8a800ff>5 kekona<>."
