        "philosophers_medallion": {
            "name": "Philosopher's Medallion",
            "option": "\n<#ff7a3eff>Transmutation<>: Ke pepehi ʻoe i nā moʻo, loaʻa iā ʻoe he <#61d1bcff>5 <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:cdr_0> hoʻowikiwiki mākau<> a me <#60e84dff>15 <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_regen_0> hoʻōla ola hou<> no <#e8a800ff>5 kekona<>. Eia hou, ʻā i ke ahi nā moʻo e hana ana i ka pōʻino iā ʻoe no <#d94c49ff>10% o ko lākou ola kiʻekiʻe<> ma ke ʻano he <#e3ab9dff>pōʻino ʻoiaʻiʻo<> i loko o <#e8a800ff>3 kekona<>, ʻaʻole ʻoi aku ma mua o <#e3ab9dff>50 pōʻino<> i kēlā me kēia kekona."
