            "option": "\nLoaʻa iā ʻoe he <#92dc7bff>16% <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:heal_shield_power_0> mana hoʻōla a me pale kaua<>.\n\n<#ff7a3eff>First Light<>: Loaʻa iā ʻoe he <#92dc7bff>2% <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:heal_shield_power_0> mana hoʻōla a me pale kaua<> a me <#a974ffff>15 <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0> mana kilokilo<> no kēlā me kēia <#61d1bcff>10 <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:cdr_0> hoʻowikiwiki mākau<>."
